      "content": "If you've never experienced chest pain like this before, I would suggest you contact a healthcare professional to rule out any serious conditions. While it could be related to stress or heartburn, it's important to get it properly evaluated to ensure it's nothing more serious. In the meantime, you can try some relaxation techniques to manage your stress, such as deep breathing or taking a short walk. But reach out to a doctor for professional advice as soon as possible.",
